      en: ["Herjólfur Bárðarson settled here as the first permanent resident around 900 AD.", "Archaeological excavations (1971–1981) uncovered several Viking longhouses.", "The valley has hosted the national Þjóðhátíð festival annually since 1874.", "A full-scale reconstruction of a Viking-era dwelling is available for touring.", "The surrounding cliffs serve as a major nesting site for Atlantic puffins.", "Much of the valley was spared from lava damage during the 1973 eruption."],
